                        "entry_id": "cec6fd70-d9b1-3675-a923-ff07aaaba148",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A success in the face of little or no opposition."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8cca9ac1-a1a7-37ff-a40e-0d7692dc6e1a",
                        "entry_id": "cec6fd70-d9b1-3675-a923-ff07aaaba148",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In the game of checkers or draughts: the act of turning a checker into a king when it has reached the farthest row forward."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3dce36c5-55b9-4244-b58e-356723077ce7",
                                "sense_id": "8cca9ac1-a1a7-37ff-a40e-0d7692dc6e1a",
                                "text": "Here, the huffing of Miss Bella and the loss of three of her men at a swoop, aggravated by the coronation of an opponent, led to that young lady's jerking the draught-board and pieces off the table: which her sister went down on her knees to pick up."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
